  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the crushed casabe, blanched and seasoned namul, sesame oil, soy sauce, rice vinegar, grated ginger, minced garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Knead the mixture until it forms a dough.",
    "Divide the dough into small balls and shape each into a songpyeon form.",
    "Place the songpyeon on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Bake the songpyeon for 20 minutes or until they are lightly browned.",
    "Remove the songpyeon from the oven and let them cool on a wire rack.",
    "Serve the songpyeon warm or at room temperature."
